SUMMARY: Use the CUSTOM COMMERCIAL LICENSE above. It gives
you the right to:
  • Showcase in your portfolio and resume (with attribution)
  • Sell, license, or transfer the software in the future
  • Preserve original authorship (JAI GUDIVADA / JAI VERSE)
  • White-label for clients while keeping authorship records
  • Grant custom exceptions to specific parties

If you later want community contributions, you can relicense
under MIT. The Custom Commercial License is the safest
starting point for commercial software you may monetize.

